body: "Produce explicit questions, unresolved assumptions and required evidence with immutable packet revisions and independent receiver receipts. Existing brief prompt/since produce prose; core claims own work ownership; pm-memory owns standing knowledge; pm-context owns context delivery and since-delta. No since-delta implementation belongs here."
